{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1113468-rakshasa-the-kingdom-featuring-the-extinction-chronicle","id":1113468,"title":"Rakshasa: the Kingdom (featuring the Extinction Chronicle)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-08T17:45:38-07:00","id":1113468,"title":"Rakshasa: the Kingdom (featuring the Extinction Chronicle)","content":"Partially inspired by Lostlight's Old One Chronicles, here is the start of a fansplat which is &quot;based&quot; on the infamous Changing Breeds.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WZiZ2vYCfRvjbf7V4GL6SgLNzF-fEkTpGdzph6MdqS0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Link to the master doc</a><br /> <br /> You play as one of the rakshasa, monstrous illusionists who can take on the guise of a beast and are consumed by vile passions. Each rakshasa is part of something bigger and grander than themselves, each rakshasa is part of a cursed dynasty which stretches back to ancient times. Each rakshasa has a prehistoric monster sealed within their soul to preventing their reincarnation, but the dynasties have learnt how to tap into this curse to manipulate the breath of life and make their illusions reality. But with each day, the rakshasa has to fight to control vices which are not their own and deal with the karmic debt of an abomination being left upon their shoulders in an effort to transform their dynasty before it becomes extinct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_bla