all written down. Just need to put in stereotypes, windrunner/wingfolk fluff, and expand the fluff of the accords.</li> <li>Chapter Two has general rakshasa information, info on how to handle the differences between this and changing breeds (with examples on how to make many different types of shapeshifters for different themes).</li> <li>Chapter Three has all the mechanics except for needing some more Karma's and needing to figureout how I want to handle the Venomous Birthright.</li> <li>Chapter Four has the system for all the Principle Siddhi which is the primary supernatural system of rakshasa.</li> </ul>I am 95% sure the system as current is going to have some bad balance problems, but it's a first draft and it's best to just the fundamentals out and then improve/refine it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}